      "igbp_comment": "Secondary Forest: Although previously disturbed by logging activities, the land is now predominantly occupied by trees, boasting a remarkable percent cover of 70% and heights surpassing 20 meters. This resilient ecosystem exhibits typical secondary forest characteristics, prominently featuring species from the Moraceae and Fabaceae families. The ongoing recovery process has reached approximately 25 years, signaling the regrowth and restoration of the forest. The area is characterized by having tree species with low wood density with an understory covered by abundant juvenile individuals with a DAP of less than 10 cm. The 15% of the land is seasonally covered by flooded forests during the rainy season"
